<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-sătio</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exat-</span></b> ), āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to satisfy</i>, <i>to satiate</i>,
				<i>glut</i>, <i>sate</i> (not
			ante-Aug.; cf. exsaturo). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exsatiati cibo vinoque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					40, 28, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">enses multo cruore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 535</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 9, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clade exsatiata domus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					8, 542</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Populum Romanum ne morte quidem P. Scipionis
					exsatiari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 38, 54, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">patruum sanguine domus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					3, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
